{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03126","headline":"酬宋使君见赠之作 · 张九龄","name":"酬宋使君见赠之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时来不自意，宿昔谬枢衡。\n翊圣负明主，妨贤媿友生。\n罢归犹右职，待罪尚南荆。\n政有留棠旧，风因继组成。\n高轩问疾苦，烝庶荷仁明。\n衰废时所薄，秪言僚故情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}